Error [E0302]: `.$track_origin` only works on a declared struct or tuple field
  --> tests/ui/tracked_origin_fact_retired.jet:3:17
    |
  3 |     print(value.$track_origin)
    |                 ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Field access needs declaration metadata instead of guessing a successful type
 Fix: Use a declared field on a struct or tuple
